From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Kelley <mikelley@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Mar 2022 09:12:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: azure: ACPI: scan: Export acpi_get_dma_attr()

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/1966098

Export acpi_get_dma_attr() so that it can be used by the Hyper-V
VMbus driver, which may be built as a module. The related function
acpi_dma_configure_id() is already exported.

Signed-off-by: Michael Kelley <mikelley@microsoft.com>
Signed-off-by: Tim Gardner <tim.gardner@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-01869
Ledger-Origin: azure-6.17@314aa4c1e00b765ab757c4294873909d6df9e340
---
 drivers/acpi/scan.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/acpi/scan.c b/drivers/acpi/scan.c
index 65dcd96ae72b..e81c631639d6 100644
--- a/drivers/acpi/scan.c
+++ b/drivers/acpi/scan.c
@@ -1535,6 +1535,7 @@ enum dev_dma_attr acpi_get_dma_attr(struct acpi_device *adev)
 	else
 		return DEV_DMA_NON_COHERENT;
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(acpi_get_dma_attr);
 
 /**
  * acpi_dma_get_range() - Get device DMA parameters.
